WEBVTT

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:11.125
"Song of the Moon"

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:22.208
Hello, everyone!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.042
Today's Gravi and Procella's joint concert!

00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:31.042
Thank you for taking the time to come to...

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:32.542
...Full Moon Festival!

00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:37.542
This day has finally come!

00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:39.708
Is everyone ready?

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.917
Then, let's get started--

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:44.750
Let's lift the curtain on Full Moon Festival!

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:23.750
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.708
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.708
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:32.542
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:36.208
♪ Shake it love, YES! ♪

00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:39.750
♪ I'm going crazy with longing ♪

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.333
♪ Brushing back my hair ♪

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:43.375
♪ That got wet in an instant ♪

00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:46.042
♪ Being toyed with by the warm rain ♪

00:01:46.042 --> 00:01:49.542
♪ Shall I see how far I can run? ♪

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.500
♪ The prayer ♪

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.542
♪ That spun out ♪

00:01:53.542 --> 00:01:56.458
♪ Connects to the future ♪

00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:57.375
♪ Overflowing ♪

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:58.875
♪ The miracle of love ♪

00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:00.792
♪ The wonderful miracle ♪

00:02:00.792 --> 00:02:03.583
♪ The voice of these six flowers ♪

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:05.792
♪ is released! (Shake it love, SAY!) ♪

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.625
♪ Pulling toward each other (So fast!) ♪

00:02:07.625 --> 00:02:09.292
♪ That power (So vast!) ♪

00:02:09.292 --> 00:02:11.583
♪ I want it to reach you ♪

00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:12.875
♪ Don't stop the music ♪

00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:14.708
♪ High in the night sky (So high!) ♪

00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:16.792
♪ I send up my excitement (Turn round!) ♪

00:02:16.792 --> 00:02:19.250
♪ Gravitic-romantic ♪

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.042
♪ Tonight ♪

00:02:20.042 --> 00:02:21.708
♪ Can't be stopped (Nonstop!) ♪

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:23.500
♪ The impulse of love (Get down!) ♪

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.625
♪ I want to mess you up ♪

00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:28.333
♪ T-T-Take it easy now! ♪

00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:29.958
♪ To embrace you ♪

00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:31.625
♪ a-a-as I feel it ♪

00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:32.375
♪ Let's dance ♪

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:35.667
♪ And once you're captivated, kiss! ♪

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.417
♪ Good love! Good love! ♪

00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:39.792
♪ Gravitic-love! ♪

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.583
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.500
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:46.958
♪ Shake it love, YES! ♪

00:02:54.292 --> 00:02:57.875
♪ Fluttering and dancing in the sky ♪

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:04.250
♪ Let our love reach you... ♪

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.000
♪ LOVE, ♪

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.083
♪ LOVE, ♪

00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:07.500
♪ LOVE... ♪

00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:11.542
♪ ohhhh... SAY! ♪

00:03:11.542 --> 00:03:12.958
♪ This heart ♪

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:15.250
♪ Try and move it ♪

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.375
♪ Look, how should I show you? ♪

00:03:18.375 --> 00:03:19.542
♪ Then together with us ♪

00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:20.917
♪ Let's dance! Take my hand ♪

00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:22.375
♪ hey yeah yeah! ♪

00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:23.875
♪ Leave it to me ♪

00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:26.792
♪ to escort you! ALL RIGHT! ♪

00:03:26.792 --> 00:03:29.500
♪ As if worrying, the passing rain ♪

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.958
♪ caressed my cheek gently,
so as not to be noticed. ♪

00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:36.917
♪ Jumping over faster than a shooting star ♪

00:03:36.917 --> 00:03:40.375
♪ Reach out your hand! ♪

00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:41.292
♪ let's get LOVE! ♪

00:03:41.292 --> 00:03:42.917
♪ Shout to the moon! (shout!) ♪

00:03:42.917 --> 00:03:44.542
♪ Let your shout ring out! (shout!) ♪

00:03:44.542 --> 00:03:45.708
♪ What's up, what's up? ♪

00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:47.458
♪ Let me hear your voice ♪

00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:49.000
♪ Undo your hair ♪

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.000
♪ Saying goodbye to yesterday ♪

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.000
♪ when my eyes were closed ♪

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.542
♪ A single petal fluttering lightly ♪

00:03:55.542 --> 00:03:57.417
♪ Spit it out, SHOUT! (shout!) ♪

00:03:57.417 --> 00:03:59.250
♪ Shout out your feelings! (shout!) ♪

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.000
♪ Isn't it fine ♪

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.125
♪ if nothing is for sure? ♪

00:04:02.125 --> 00:04:03.167
♪ wow yeah! ♪

00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:03.667
♪ That's right ♪

00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:05.500
♪ Let's put away the lies ♪

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.208
♪ Let lots of love reach you ♪

00:04:12.708 --> 00:04:15.125
♪ Let lots of love reach you ♪

00:04:36.292 --> 00:04:39.542
Now, it's time to start this dream.

00:04:39.542 --> 00:04:43.042
Let's all run through to the end together.

00:04:43.042 --> 00:04:45.417
Shall we? Let's start with the solo medley!

00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:49.417
♪ Let's do our best tomorrow, too ♪

00:04:49.417 --> 00:04:52.542
♪ I like you who likes me when I do my best ♪

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:55.667
♪ If I'm gonna hold my knees ♪

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:57.958
♪ Then I might as well turn a somersault like that ♪

00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:00.208
♪ Winter nights when I'm numb with cold ♪

00:05:00.208 --> 00:05:03.292
♪ And summer vacation
with my sweat-drenched T-shirts ♪

00:05:03.292 --> 00:05:06.250
♪ They might not be too bad ♪

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:10.958
♪ Rising spirits glittering ♪

00:05:21.167 --> 00:05:24.875
♪ Even if I fall seven times ♪

00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:31.958
♪ I'll get up eight times ♪

00:05:32.375 --> 00:05:33.083
Here I go!

00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:34.375
♪ "Never Ending Challenge!!" ♪

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:36.208
♪ Far away in the distance ♪

00:05:36.208 --> 00:05:38.958
♪ I gaze at the white tape ♪

00:05:38.958 --> 00:05:41.458
♪ Never taking my eyes off it ♪

00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:42.958
♪ I just have to run through it ♪

00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:44.167
"Iku"
♪ I just have to run through it ♪

00:05:44.167 --> 00:05:44.917
"Iku"
♪ Renewing my vow right now ♪

00:05:44.917 --> 00:05:46.833
♪ Renewing my vow right now ♪

00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:49.750
♪ It's been my dream ever since I was young ♪

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.875
♪ Feeling the wind in the blue heights ♪

00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:56.125
♪ Make a wish!  ♪

00:06:01.042 --> 00:06:06.917
♪ A completely free world
that no one has ever seen ♪

00:06:06.917 --> 00:06:12.833
♪ We want to choose the high, faraway heights ♪

00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:18.750
♪ If I manage to take even your fingertips,
I won't let go for anything ♪

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.708
♪ That's what we chosen ones are ♪

00:06:21.708 --> 00:06:26.000
♪ We Few, We Happy Few ♪

00:06:38.208 --> 00:06:45.708
♪ Running on a seventeen degree slope ♪

00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:48.000
♪ To tomorrow ♪

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:52.917
♪ Opening my eyes wide to etch
the moment into my mind ♪

00:06:52.917 --> 00:06:57.250
♪ The sky, the city, and that face--everything ♪

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:06.042
♪ I'm sure it's because of you
that even though I wavered ♪

00:07:06.042 --> 00:07:10.667
♪ I was able to make it here ♪

00:07:22.917 --> 00:07:31.250
♪ Let's find an answer for just the two of us
as we come to a mutual understanding ♪

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:39.667
♪ Because unstained me is you,
just you as you are ♪

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:47.958
♪ Shining white, let our hearts overlap as they are ♪

00:07:47.958 --> 00:07:56.958
♪ Resounding together,
we are pure just as we are ♪

00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:13.958
Hello!

00:08:14.375 --> 00:08:15.667
Hello!

00:08:15.667 --> 00:08:16.667
Yoo-hoo!

00:08:16.667 --> 00:08:18.250
Are you all having fun?

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:25.917
This is the talk section...
Put your hands together!

00:08:27.667 --> 00:08:33.042
Now, what will the four of us talk about?

00:08:33.042 --> 00:08:35.208
Well, for the four of us in the middle,

00:08:35.208 --> 00:08:39.542
we should probably talk about
the play, Dreamflower, right?

00:08:39.542 --> 00:08:42.125
It was our first time in lead roles,
and we were double cast.

00:08:42.125 --> 00:08:46.417
Including rehearsals,
it was a really intense time.

00:08:46.417 --> 00:08:47.875
Yeah...

00:08:47.875 --> 00:08:50.042
For a while after our first meeting,

00:08:50.042 --> 00:08:53.542
we brought our scripts with us
everywhere, muttering to ourselves...

00:08:53.542 --> 00:08:56.125
All four of us worked really hard, huh?

00:08:56.125 --> 00:08:59.917
Oh, but the one who seemed to have
the most trouble was...

00:08:59.917 --> 00:09:01.333
...Arata.

00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:02.833
Who, me?

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:04.542
Yes, you.

00:09:04.542 --> 00:09:06.458
You knew it, too, right?

00:09:06.458 --> 00:09:10.042
You were chewed out by Mikaduki
every day, remember?

00:09:10.042 --> 00:09:12.833
If you're gonna say that, so were you.

00:09:12.833 --> 00:09:15.875
He got mad at you for moving too much
during the sword fights, right?

00:09:15.875 --> 00:09:18.208
Idiot, don't tell the whole world!

00:09:18.208 --> 00:09:23.042
Speaking of which,
Mikaduki should be here today, too.

00:09:23.042 --> 00:09:26.042
Mikaduki, are you watching?

00:09:26.042 --> 00:09:30.292
Are you waving my color glow stick?

00:09:30.292 --> 00:09:32.042
I don't think so.

00:09:32.042 --> 00:09:33.375
No way.

00:09:33.375 --> 00:09:35.167
What's that, Arata?

00:09:35.167 --> 00:09:37.542
Leave your love call for later.

00:09:37.542 --> 00:09:39.292
How do you do, everyone?

00:09:39.292 --> 00:09:40.958
It's me, Shun.

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:44.458
Hello! Are you enjoying yourselves?

00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:45.958
Hello.

00:09:45.958 --> 00:09:49.750
Now, it's us old guys' turn.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:53.500
Shall we look back on work
that left an impression on us, too?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.708
Oh, yes, let's do that.

00:09:56.708 --> 00:10:01.125
Oh, I was allowed to be
manager for a day at Animate!

00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:06.042
Did everyone get the Manager Haru bunny?

00:10:06.042 --> 00:10:11.542
For me, I went on location at
an amusement park, and an island...

00:10:11.542 --> 00:10:14.375
I went all over the place.

00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:17.333
The island was especially memorable!

00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:19.125
Oh, yes, that.

00:10:19.125 --> 00:10:21.083
A lot happened, huh?

00:10:21.083 --> 00:10:23.417
The bridge burned down and stuff, right?

00:10:23.417 --> 00:10:26.042
It was a major incident.

00:10:27.292 --> 00:10:30.917
We overcame various obstacles together
and deepened our bonds,

00:10:30.917 --> 00:10:34.250
and now we're here performing for you.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:37.833
It's pretty profound if you
think about it that way, right?

00:10:37.833 --> 00:10:40.208
You summed it up nicely, huh?

00:10:40.208 --> 00:10:44.583
Of course. Because I am Procellarum's leader.

00:10:44.583 --> 00:10:48.292
And... one of Hajime's fans!

00:10:48.292 --> 00:10:50.333
Now, all together now...

00:10:50.333 --> 00:10:52.583
L-O-V-E...

00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:54.833
Hajime love!

00:10:54.833 --> 00:10:56.125
Thanks!

00:10:56.125 --> 00:10:58.667
This audience is great!

00:10:58.667 --> 00:11:02.042
Thank you for always supporting us.

00:11:03.292 --> 00:11:04.708
Love...!

00:11:04.708 --> 00:11:05.667
Um...

00:11:05.667 --> 00:11:09.625
Can we come out now?

00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:11.583
Oh, our youngest group.

00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:14.583
Sorry. Come on out!

00:11:14.583 --> 00:11:16.708
Hello.

00:11:16.708 --> 00:11:19.417
So, what're we supposed to talk about again?

00:11:19.417 --> 00:11:22.375
What you worked hard at recently.

00:11:22.375 --> 00:11:24.792
During the Animate manager-for-a-day event,

00:11:24.792 --> 00:11:27.250
I danced the Tsukiusa calisthenics!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.542
Wearing the Tsukiusa
bunny costumes and dancing to

00:11:29.542 --> 00:11:33.917
♪ "Copy, copy, copy, copy, try and copy us"! ♪

00:11:34.833 --> 00:11:36.958
No one noticed, after all, huh?

00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:39.125
I danced, too!

00:11:40.167 --> 00:11:45.250
Normally, you wouldn't think the idols
themselves would be in there, huh?

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:48.833
I want to try wearing the costumes, too.

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:50.375
No, you don't.

00:11:50.375 --> 00:11:52.750
It's pretty hard work.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.583
I'm serious.

00:11:55.667 --> 00:11:59.250
I worked hard at cheering on Ikkun.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.500
Oh, yeah.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.833
Thanks!

00:12:02.833 --> 00:12:06.167
Are you talking about when Iku
was in the track meet?

00:12:06.167 --> 00:12:09.750
Yeah, I was on the track team
before I debuted as an idol,

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.292
so I wanted to work hard at both.

00:12:12.292 --> 00:12:14.417
Rui's cheering me on, too,

00:12:14.417 --> 00:12:16.375
so I'll keep doing my best!

00:12:20.125 --> 00:12:23.500
After this...

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:27.083
...keep enjoying the music and songs
with everything you've got!

00:12:27.083 --> 00:12:29.125
We'll keep running through to the end!

00:12:29.125 --> 00:12:32.167
Now, for the second half...

00:12:32.167 --> 00:12:34.500
Let's keep this energy going!

00:12:44.042 --> 00:12:49.375
♪ I'm reflected in a puddle ♪

00:12:49.375 --> 00:12:53.083
♪ That makes my image shake ♪

00:12:53.083 --> 00:12:58.792
♪ Even so, it's the same urge again ♪

00:12:58.792 --> 00:13:04.250
♪ Accelerating to chase that cloud ♪

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:09.417
♪ I stretch my hand out over and over,
but it won't reach ♪

00:13:09.417 --> 00:13:14.875
♪ That hidden lie and stagnant past ♪

00:13:14.875 --> 00:13:22.500
♪ I wonder if they will both melt away
in the warmth flowing by ♪

00:13:27.667 --> 00:13:34.542
♪ On the day when I was led to a row
of cherry trees and found you ♪

00:13:34.542 --> 00:13:41.625
♪ As I passed through,
the fragrance of spring caressed my chest ♪

00:13:41.625 --> 00:13:45.125
♪ Let's walk facing forward ♪

00:13:45.125 --> 00:13:48.500
♪ I'll be fine ♪

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:53.167
♪ I'll pull your hand along ♪

00:13:53.167 --> 00:13:57.208
♪ Toward the brilliant future ♪

00:14:07.417 --> 00:14:10.083
♪ That clear voice ♪

00:14:10.083 --> 00:14:12.833
♪ My hand was always drawn to ♪

00:14:12.833 --> 00:14:19.333
♪ On a journey through my memories ♪

00:14:19.333 --> 00:14:21.875
♪ The record we etched together ♪

00:14:21.875 --> 00:14:24.667
♪ Listened to on repeat so much it's worn out ♪

00:14:24.667 --> 00:14:27.417
♪ It became unplayable some time ago ♪

00:14:27.417 --> 00:14:30.125
♪ And now it's just an object ♪

00:14:30.125 --> 00:14:32.792
♪ I can still see it on the back of my eyelids ♪

00:14:32.792 --> 00:14:35.542
♪ If I listen carefully, I can hear it ♪

00:14:35.542 --> 00:14:38.292
♪ As the seasons pass, and I grow older ♪

00:14:38.292 --> 00:14:44.500
♪ It grows dimmer, though ♪

00:14:46.708 --> 00:14:57.417
♪ But I know that nothing stays the same forever ♪

00:14:57.417 --> 00:15:05.958
♪ Warbler, sing again as the seasons change ♪

00:15:05.958 --> 00:15:09.292
♪ Look for spring ♪

00:15:09.292 --> 00:15:15.083
♪ Precious things become memories ♪

00:15:15.083 --> 00:15:19.917
♪ Even if they spill out of these hands ♪

00:15:19.917 --> 00:15:23.125
♪ We will not stop ♪

00:15:23.125 --> 00:15:31.625
♪ The warmth that is in this chest ♪

00:15:31.625 --> 00:15:33.792
♪ I know what it is ♪

00:15:33.792 --> 00:15:35.042
♪ Right? ♪

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:39.708
♪ Even if nothing special has happened ♪

00:15:39.708 --> 00:15:43.292
♪ It's fine if we can just laugh ♪

00:15:43.292 --> 00:15:50.583
♪ As long as this moment keeps making us happy ♪

00:15:50.583 --> 00:15:53.458
♪ amor, amor, I'll be by your side ♪

00:15:53.458 --> 00:15:57.542
♪ I can hear the beating of your heart ♪

00:15:57.542 --> 00:16:04.750
♪ I will always connect to you, over and over ♪

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:07.750
♪ amor, amor, the feelings there ♪

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:11.750
♪ that you want to hold dear ♪

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:20.875
♪ Please tell me with your voice someday ♪

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:26.833
♪ They fall deep to the bottom of the ocean ♪

00:16:26.833 --> 00:16:29.083
♪ These words ♪

00:16:29.083 --> 00:16:34.333
♪ Aiming for the depths of my heart ♪

00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:37.458
♪ These kind encouragements ♪

00:16:37.458 --> 00:16:40.500
♪ These words of sympathy ♪

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:46.333
♪ Drop their anchors silently ♪

00:16:46.333 --> 00:16:49.792
♪ The words you dropped ♪

00:16:49.792 --> 00:16:53.083
♪ Shake the sea of my heart ♪

00:16:53.083 --> 00:16:54.750
♪ The ripples on the water ♪

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:59.125
♪ Shine bright rainbows ♪

00:16:59.125 --> 00:16:59.667
♪ I, too, ♪

00:16:59.667 --> 00:17:02.208
♪ want to respond to you ♪

00:17:02.208 --> 00:17:05.458
♪ I will find the words ♪

00:17:05.458 --> 00:17:12.292
♪ Can you stay by my side until then? ♪

00:17:16.292 --> 00:17:20.167
♪ Flowers of snow flutter and dance as they fall ♪

00:17:20.167 --> 00:17:24.000
♪ They flutter and pile up in my heart ♪

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:31.667
♪ A single petal of brilliant purple takes you away ♪

00:17:31.667 --> 00:17:39.375
♪ They flutter and dance in the gray sky ♪

00:17:39.375 --> 00:17:46.958
♪ The brilliance of a single petal
stands out in the sky beautifully ♪

00:17:46.958 --> 00:17:54.792
♪ Together with the song
that marks the beginning ♪

00:18:22.583 --> 00:18:24.250
Thanks.

00:18:28.917 --> 00:18:32.250
How are you doing?
Have you caught your breath, Hajime?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.375
Yeah. Thanks, everyone!

00:18:35.375 --> 00:18:37.250
Are you having fun?

00:18:38.542 --> 00:18:39.958
Good.

00:18:40.875 --> 00:18:43.500
The black king's in a good mood.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:48.708
Which means the white demon king--that is,
me--is also in a <i>very </i>good mood!

00:18:48.708 --> 00:18:50.333
It's thanks to you all.

00:18:50.333 --> 00:18:51.958
Thank you.

00:18:51.958 --> 00:18:54.833
The end is drawing near, huh?

00:18:54.833 --> 00:18:55.958
Are you sad?

00:18:55.958 --> 00:18:57.083
No.

00:18:57.083 --> 00:18:59.875
This is the end, but it's also the beginning.

00:19:01.125 --> 00:19:04.458
We're still in the middle of our dream.

00:19:04.458 --> 00:19:07.667
That's why there's no need to be sad.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.083
Right, Shun?

00:19:11.958 --> 00:19:13.917
That's exactly right.

00:19:13.917 --> 00:19:17.417
Those of you in the audience
should remember that, too.

00:19:17.417 --> 00:19:22.292
We are always by your side.

00:19:23.875 --> 00:19:30.917
We are here because many people raised
their voices to make their feelings known,

00:19:30.917 --> 00:19:34.167
pushing us forward.

00:19:34.167 --> 00:19:40.167
The days may seem ordinary,
but precious times accumulate every day.

00:19:40.167 --> 00:19:46.500
It's because of these ordinary days
that special days like this can shine.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:51.917
Each and every encounter helps us grow.

00:19:51.917 --> 00:19:57.833
Each and every memory makes us stronger.

00:19:57.833 --> 00:20:05.583
It's thanks to the time we've spent together that
we can bring our voices and our songs to you.

00:20:05.583 --> 00:20:08.875
That's why this song is for you!

00:20:08.875 --> 00:20:15.083
This is a present from us, Gravi and Procella,
to each and every one of you.

00:20:15.083 --> 00:20:18.458
Front and back become one...

00:20:18.458 --> 00:20:21.792
Put the two together for one whole moon.

00:20:21.792 --> 00:20:25.208
That's right, it's the birth of the full moon!

00:20:26.333 --> 00:20:29.208
Let's go, Six Gravity!

00:20:29.208 --> 00:20:31.792
Come, Procellarum.

00:20:46.208 --> 00:20:49.042
♪ One, two, three, let's start ♪

00:20:49.042 --> 00:20:51.750
♪ This performance featuring just us ♪

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:54.625
♪ Four, five, Six Gravity ♪

00:20:54.625 --> 00:20:57.375
♪ Just this one day out of the whole year ♪

00:20:57.375 --> 00:21:00.167
♪ 1, 2, 3 with you ♪

00:21:00.167 --> 00:21:02.708
♪ Harmonizing the best kind of love ♪

00:21:02.708 --> 00:21:05.500
♪ 4, 5 Rock! Procellarum ♪

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.792
♪ Let's face the future with a party tonight ♪

00:21:11.125 --> 00:21:14.000
♪ Shining, soaring ♪

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.792
♪ Wishing upon a star ♪

00:21:16.792 --> 00:21:19.542
♪ With yearning and love ♪

00:21:19.542 --> 00:21:22.333
♪ Like a spell that can't be broken ♪

00:21:22.333 --> 00:21:25.167
♪ Swooping down nimbly ♪

00:21:25.167 --> 00:21:27.958
♪ Looking for a new hope ♪

00:21:27.958 --> 00:21:30.750
♪ High in this blue sky ♪

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.542
♪ Let's climb forever ♪

00:21:33.542 --> 00:21:44.875
♪ (Right now) When the door opens,
let's go through one by one ♪

00:21:44.875 --> 00:21:55.792
♪ In this small hand are gathered
encounters and farewells ♪

00:21:55.792 --> 00:21:58.583
♪ There's no such thing as unending rain ♪

00:21:58.583 --> 00:22:01.458
♪ It wipes away my tears ♪

00:22:01.458 --> 00:22:04.292
♪ Lots of precious things ♪

00:22:04.292 --> 00:22:07.000
♪ To fight for and win ♪

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.833
♪ The sun shines ♪

00:22:09.833 --> 00:22:12.583
♪ On a paradise of goddesses ♪

00:22:12.583 --> 00:22:15.458
♪ Shall we go beyond this long night ♪

00:22:15.458 --> 00:22:18.125
♪ and greet the future? ♪

00:22:18.125 --> 00:22:23.542
♪ The faraway dream ♪

00:22:23.542 --> 00:22:24.458
♪ Memories ♪

00:22:24.458 --> 00:22:29.125
♪ Sunk into the ocean ♪

00:22:29.125 --> 00:22:30.250
♪ Flowing away ♪

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:34.750
♪ Disappearing ♪

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:40.833
♪ Swallowed by the times ♪

00:22:40.833 --> 00:22:43.708
♪ In the darkness before your eyes ♪

00:22:43.708 --> 00:22:46.458
♪ The light fumbles as it cuts through ♪

00:22:46.458 --> 00:22:47.458
♪ You're not alone ♪

00:22:47.458 --> 00:22:49.042
♪ We're all with you ♪

00:22:49.042 --> 00:22:50.125
♪ Step out ♪

00:22:50.125 --> 00:22:51.292
♪ Toward the moon ♪

00:22:51.292 --> 00:22:53.042
♪ Start running with us ♪

00:22:53.042 --> 00:22:55.583
♪ Become the wind blowing
to the ends of the earth ♪

00:22:55.583 --> 00:22:57.042
♪ Never ending ♪

00:22:57.042 --> 00:22:59.917
♪ Flowing into our throbbing hearts ♪

00:22:59.917 --> 00:23:02.417
♪ We want to fill them with your love ♪

00:23:02.417 --> 00:23:05.417
♪ Dance our dance and the dance of the wind ♪

00:23:05.417 --> 00:23:08.208
♪ All twelve of us one on top of the other ♪

00:23:08.208 --> 00:23:11.000
♪ A symphony that stirs up a storm ♪

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:15.167
♪ Because we want to make your dream come true ♪

00:23:15.167 --> 00:23:17.417
♪ Here comes ♪

00:23:17.417 --> 00:23:42.102
♪ The song of the moon ♪
